# Issue #1333, U3: GTAORenderPass::Setup() declares the denoise pong only
# when denoising is on, and that gate was not in the declaration key, so
# turning denoise on reused a graph with no pong and published "no
# occlusion" every frame.
olo-state-machine-trace 1
seed 0
initial path=forward size=320x180 msaa=1 upscale=off features= blended=0 buffering=2 pose=0
op feature gtao on
op feature gtao-denoise on
op feature gtao-denoise off
op path deferred
op feature gtao-denoise on
op resize 384x216
